### Post-process query results in TypeScript

Source: https://github.com/514-labs/moosestack/blob/main/apps/framework-docs-v2/content/moosestack/apis/analytics-api.mdx

Uses the Api class to fetch raw data and map it to a structured response format with transformed fields and derived values.

```typescript
interface QueryParams {
  category: string;
  maxResults: number;
}

interface ResponseBody {
  itemId: number;
  displayName: string;
  formattedValue: string;
  isHighValue: boolean;
  date: string;
}

const processDataApi = new Api<QueryParams, ResponseBody>(
  "process_data_endpoint",
  async ({ category, maxResults = 10 }, { client, sql }) => {
    // 1. Fetch raw data
    const query = sql.statement`
      SELECT id, name, value, timestamp
      FROM data_table
      WHERE category = ${category}
      LIMIT ${maxResults}
    `;

    const rawResults = await client.query.execute<{
      id: number;
      name: string;
      value: number;
      timestamp: string;
    }>(query);

    // 2. Post-process the results
    return rawResults.map(row => ({
      // Transform field names
      itemId: row.id,
      displayName: row.name.toUpperCase(),

      // Add derived fields
      formattedValue: `$${row.value.toFixed(2)}`,
      isHighValue: row.value > 1000,

      // Format dates
      date: new Date(row.timestamp).toISOString().split('T')[0]
    }));
  }
);
```

--------------------------------

### Define a Basic API Endpoint in TypeScript

Source: https://github.com/514-labs/moosestack/blob/main/apps/framework-docs-v2/content/moosestack/apis/analytics-api.mdx

Define an API endpoint with query parameters and a result type. Ensure `SourceTable` is not null using `!`. The `client.query.execute` method is used to run the SQL query.

```typescript
```ts filename="ExampleApi.ts" copy
import { Api } from "@514labs/moose-lib";
import { SourcePipeline } from "path/to/SourcePipeline"; 

